WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.509 --> 01:46.830
=Episode 30=

02:01.480 --> 02:05.200
Ying Xuwei, they've entered
the Mist Soul. Where is the key ring?

02:07.080 --> 02:08.600
Sorry for keeping you waiting,
Miss Shuo Xuan.

02:48.360 --> 02:52.920
General Lin Yuan, Zhu Yu tried
to take the Rehai key ring by force.

02:53.800 --> 02:55.280
I wonder, in your opinion,

02:55.280 --> 02:58.920
how the contractual relationship
between us should proceed.

03:00.000 --> 03:03.960
When we meet again another day
after our parting today,

03:05.160 --> 03:06.400
we should rely on what we each have.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.420
Guixu

03:26.840 --> 03:30.040
is the final resting place
of all memories in the world.

03:32.760 --> 03:36.120
Even the most thrilling
and poignant memories

03:38.640 --> 03:39.730
will be like

03:41.640 --> 03:43.560
the most ordinary flowing water
in Guixu.

04:02.040 --> 04:03.120
What did you see?

04:05.360 --> 04:09.040
I saw a lot of things
that I had already forgotten.

04:18.079 --> 04:22.040
Upon reflection,
my life hasn't been wasted.

04:34.400 --> 04:37.240
When I returned last time,
this dragon horn was missing a piece.

04:37.240 --> 04:38.600
Now it's complete.

04:39.960 --> 04:42.040
It seems that during these three years,

04:42.040 --> 04:44.520
not only us but others
have also come to the Dragon Pool.

04:45.440 --> 04:46.680
It was taken by Xuwei.

04:48.240 --> 04:49.520
Why do you need this dragon horn?

04:50.600 --> 04:52.520
To forge a fake Rehai key ring.

04:55.640 --> 04:57.880
The real one
is in your possession, isn't it?

05:00.960 --> 05:03.680
The Rehai key ring was originally
crafted from dragon bones.

05:05.000 --> 05:07.920
The divine power lingering on the bones
can confound Zhu Yu,

05:08.960 --> 05:12.120
making her believe that the key ring
we surrendered is real.

05:12.920 --> 05:14.640
Why did you do that?

05:16.360 --> 05:17.390
It's a long story.

05:18.320 --> 05:21.520
You should ask Xuwei after you get out.

05:32.360 --> 05:33.360
Qingfei!

05:34.920 --> 05:36.960
Qingfei, you're finally back.

05:36.960 --> 05:39.320
Where did you go
without taking me along?

05:40.159 --> 05:42.440
I want to know
when Luohuan will be back.

05:46.440 --> 05:51.080
Qingfei, why won't any of you tell me
where Luohuan has actually gone?

05:51.080 --> 05:53.280
Is it because that place
is very far away

05:53.280 --> 05:54.520
and he has to go for a long time?

05:56.920 --> 06:01.320
What if Luohuan never comes back?

06:03.280 --> 06:05.040
Is Luohuan going
to a very dangerous place?

06:06.160 --> 06:07.880
He's been injured.

06:07.880 --> 06:10.520
Qingfei, quickly tell me
where Luohuan is,

06:10.520 --> 06:11.660
so I can go protect him.

06:13.640 --> 06:14.640
Silly you.

06:15.520 --> 06:18.720
Do you think Xuwei and I
don't care about Luohuan's safety?

06:19.600 --> 06:24.160
Rest assured.
He... He's just gone to heal.

06:25.200 --> 06:26.220
When he returns,

06:27.040 --> 06:29.600
he'll certainly
be lively and safe again.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.040
Really?

06:33.760 --> 06:34.800
Yes.

06:37.360 --> 06:38.920
He had me worried for nothing.

06:39.760 --> 06:40.840
When he comes back,

06:40.840 --> 06:43.600
I'll make him make 100 grass dragonflies
for me personally,

06:44.440 --> 06:45.560
and each one has to be different.

06:47.560 --> 06:49.080
Are you trying to torture him?

06:50.159 --> 06:51.220
Yes, that's right.

06:57.000 --> 07:00.360
Qingfei, what's wrong?
Are your eyes bothering you?

07:02.440 --> 07:06.560
Yes, a big grain of sand got in my eye.

07:24.560 --> 07:26.360
In this long stream of memories,

07:27.240 --> 07:28.880
why can't I find your memories?

07:39.720 --> 07:40.920
We come from three years later.

07:43.760 --> 07:44.820
Three years later?

07:48.200 --> 07:50.920
I need to seek information
in your memory.

08:02.040 --> 08:04.120
I'm already aware of your identities
and your intentions.

08:07.440 --> 08:09.840
I cannot create, but only exchange.

08:10.720 --> 08:13.640
Your existence will totally disappear
as a price.

08:15.160 --> 08:18.360
From now on, no one in this world
will remember you.

08:19.520 --> 08:20.880
Even I will not be an exception.

08:22.680 --> 08:25.320
Are you ready?

08:27.480 --> 08:30.720
To be honest, no.

08:36.559 --> 08:37.799
I have been forgotten before.

08:39.720 --> 08:41.000
That kind of fear and despair still

08:42.280 --> 08:47.080
feels suffocating upon recollection,
even after many years.

08:49.440 --> 08:50.480
And now,

08:52.200 --> 08:58.400
Xuwei, Qingfei, Xiaoyuan,

09:07.920 --> 09:09.760
and all the other people I cherish
will forget me.

09:11.920 --> 09:13.680
No matter how much more time
I am given to prepare,

09:15.760 --> 09:16.850
I simply cannot accept it.

09:23.560 --> 09:27.800
But only I can make the exchange
for Yue Jinzhao, right?

09:31.240 --> 09:34.080
The mark of Qi is engraved on your soul.

09:34.920 --> 09:36.920
This isn't something
owned by life itself.

09:37.720 --> 09:38.800
I also cannot create it.

09:40.360 --> 09:44.080
Since you have a wish in your heart,
come forward then.

09:49.600 --> 09:53.440
Willing to sacrifice his life
for someone completely unrelated...

09:56.640 --> 09:57.740
These humans...

09:59.960 --> 10:02.320
I actually view the Hengdao Sect
with renewed respect.

10:03.800 --> 10:07.160
If it were me,
I would make the exchange too.

10:12.720 --> 10:13.780
I will.

10:16.040 --> 10:17.070
Thank you.

10:21.280 --> 10:22.440
It is I who should thank you.

10:24.240 --> 10:28.040
There are many things I can't do,
but you can.

10:30.800 --> 10:31.820
Yue Jinzhao,

10:34.280 --> 10:37.000
I also have a gift for the reborn you.

10:39.520 --> 10:40.560
What is it?

10:42.440 --> 10:44.040
I've been secretly watching you
for a long time.

10:45.720 --> 10:49.080
I have witnessed
most of what you have experienced.

10:58.000 --> 11:01.640
I will seal some of my memories
into your left eye.

11:03.600 --> 11:08.840
Consider it
my final compensation to you.

11:12.800 --> 11:14.680
So every time,
the images my left eye sees

11:17.000 --> 11:18.060
are those you have seen.

11:24.040 --> 11:26.960
Bian Luohuan, take care.

11:28.400 --> 11:30.600
Farewell, Yue Jinzhao.

11:35.960 --> 11:36.980
Bian Luohuan,

11:42.680 --> 11:43.760
I don't resent you anymore.

11:47.440 --> 11:51.320
Qi, farewell.

12:11.640 --> 12:13.900
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

12:14.540 --> 12:15.600
Master.

12:16.270 --> 12:18.580
♪Let go of all regrets♪

12:18.580 --> 12:24.460
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

12:25.260 --> 12:29.140
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

12:29.140 --> 12:33.650
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

12:34.580 --> 12:38.220
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

12:39.440 --> 12:41.420
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

12:41.420 --> 12:44.590
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

12:44.590 --> 12:46.420
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

12:46.420 --> 12:50.800
♪I have no regrets♪

12:50.800 --> 12:55.920
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

12:55.920 --> 12:59.020
♪I pray for a miracle♪

12:59.800 --> 13:03.040
Surpass your past self.
Everything starts today.

13:04.200 --> 13:07.200
Your name is called Yue Jinzhao.

13:09.620 --> 13:14.740
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

13:14.740 --> 13:22.540
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

13:33.970 --> 13:37.360
♪Falling in the loop of time and space♪

13:38.260 --> 13:40.620
♪Memories are flying by♪

13:40.620 --> 13:46.450
♪I'll follow you,
whether it's right or wrong♪

13:47.570 --> 13:50.960
♪If the end can be changed♪

13:51.680 --> 13:52.720
Take good care of her for me.

13:56.720 --> 14:00.400
♪I'll go through life and death
with you♪

14:01.620 --> 14:03.660
♪My love never stops♪

14:03.660 --> 14:06.740
♪No matter how bumpy
the road to our reunion is♪

14:08.240 --> 14:09.260
Master.

14:09.840 --> 14:13.390
♪I have no regrets♪

14:13.390 --> 14:18.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

14:18.290 --> 14:21.810
♪I pray for a miracle♪

14:23.120 --> 14:24.210
I am Bian Luohuan.

14:25.780 --> 14:28.820
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

14:28.820 --> 14:31.950
♪Of being with you forever♪

14:31.950 --> 14:37.650
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

14:37.650 --> 14:41.550
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

14:42.200 --> 14:43.250
- Qi!
- Qi!

14:47.920 --> 14:51.060
♪Miracle♪

14:51.060 --> 14:53.100
♪I will protect you in my life♪

14:53.100 --> 14:57.780
♪That's my love for you♪

14:58.960 --> 15:01.200
Do you believe them or me?

15:03.560 --> 15:04.640
I believe Jinzhao.

15:06.280 --> 15:10.060
Is your master important to you?

15:10.720 --> 15:12.440
Once you return
to your own time and space,

15:13.240 --> 15:16.280
the Dragon Pool will reclaim
all memories of the exchangers.

15:16.960 --> 15:20.080
From then on, there will be
no Bian Luohuan in the world.

15:20.760 --> 15:25.560
My left eye should never be able
to see his memories again.

16:02.000 --> 16:04.400
Huan, goodbye.

16:41.040 --> 16:44.940
Jinzhao, I'm looking forward
to the next three years.

16:47.320 --> 16:49.400
We will all be waiting for you
three years from now.

16:49.400 --> 16:51.040
You must bring Little Yue
to visit us, okay?

16:52.120 --> 16:55.160
Everything that happens
in this world is destined.

16:56.680 --> 16:59.840
I didn't expect
we would have such a strong connection.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.600
It's rare that you are so moved.

17:04.200 --> 17:08.280
Alright, it's time to go. We have to
take them to Wuyan Village.

17:10.920 --> 17:11.950
It's time to leave.

17:13.040 --> 17:14.319
I will send you back.

17:32.160 --> 17:35.440
Yue Jinzhao, do you believe in fate?

17:40.600 --> 17:41.600
Someone once told me

17:42.640 --> 17:45.160
that fate is just a possibility
that can be changed.

17:46.040 --> 17:47.060
It makes a lot of sense.

17:49.920 --> 17:52.040
The previous Guardian of Pureness
said that, right?

17:53.200 --> 17:56.920
But do you still remember
when the Cold Marrow Garrison prophesied

17:57.840 --> 18:01.520
that two out of the six of you
would soon pass away?

18:03.120 --> 18:04.180
Yes, I do.

18:05.320 --> 18:06.440
In the near future,

18:07.560 --> 18:10.440
your life will come to an end.

18:23.920 --> 18:25.880
I have my sword and my companions.

18:27.120 --> 18:30.080
I will let fate take the path it should.

18:52.400 --> 18:55.720
Later on, the people from Hengdao Sect
will come looking for us.

19:04.360 --> 19:05.520
The Yunlai Stone is glowing.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.550
The Yunlai Stone is approaching.

19:20.400 --> 19:23.520
Master once came to check
because of the anomaly of Pureness.

19:25.720 --> 19:30.440
Ming Xiu, if you want
to find Mr. Gu, just go.

19:36.080 --> 19:39.960
Go on. See him once more.

20:32.320 --> 20:35.840
Master, I'll first go to the den
and defeat the demon beasts.

20:36.880 --> 20:40.320
And then, after I return,

20:41.240 --> 20:44.360
could you pin a hibiscus flower
in my hair for me?

20:49.080 --> 20:50.920
I don't care. That's a deal, then.

21:29.040 --> 21:30.060
Who is it?

21:36.040 --> 21:37.040
Master.

21:39.480 --> 21:40.560
Xiu.

21:58.440 --> 22:01.560
Xiu, are you from the future?

22:07.160 --> 22:08.640
Has something happened in the future?

22:10.560 --> 22:12.200
Have you suffered a lot?

22:22.520 --> 22:26.280
Alright, Xiu, you still have me here.

22:49.080 --> 22:52.000
When did you inherit the position
of Guardian of Pureness?

22:59.360 --> 23:00.370
Three years later.

23:09.920 --> 23:10.960
Three years...

23:17.200 --> 23:22.120
So, I can only be with you
for three more years.

24:13.880 --> 24:14.960
Master,

24:17.200 --> 24:21.120
could you pin a hibiscus flower
in my hair for me?

24:58.120 --> 25:03.720
Indeed, this hibiscus
is a worthy match for you.

25:04.530 --> 25:06.640
♪And the falling snow♪

25:06.640 --> 25:11.860
♪Can't bear to see your tears♪

25:13.390 --> 25:17.710
♪I can't be without you♪

25:17.710 --> 25:22.990
♪Take away my frail life♪

25:27.480 --> 25:32.080
Xiu, take care.

25:36.080 --> 25:38.160
♪With the lightest whisper♪

25:38.160 --> 25:40.460
♪You make the harshest decision♪

25:40.460 --> 25:47.310
♪It's not different
from the extreme penalty♪

25:49.620 --> 25:54.380
♪If you really have the heart
to leave me alone♪

25:55.440 --> 26:00.620
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

26:00.620 --> 26:06.100
♪What I thought would be evergreen
withers between my fingers♪

26:06.100 --> 26:12.080
♪Even our hug feels unnatural♪

26:12.080 --> 26:17.040
♪If it's all fate♪

26:17.840 --> 26:23.090
♪Don't question who has betrayed love♪

26:23.090 --> 26:25.970
♪If there's no hope for a reunion♪

26:25.970 --> 26:29.970
♪Don't eavesdrop on me in the dream♪

26:29.970 --> 26:34.670
♪Singing my yearning♪

26:34.670 --> 26:39.660
♪If you really have the heart
to leave me alone♪

26:40.750 --> 26:46.100
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

26:46.100 --> 26:51.820
♪What I thought would be evergreen
withers between my fingers♪

26:51.820 --> 26:56.910
♪Even our hug feels unnatural♪

26:59.480 --> 27:03.360
Master, I have dealt
with all the demons inside.

27:04.020 --> 27:08.690
♪Don't question who has betrayed love♪

27:12.320 --> 27:15.560
Master, my flower...

27:17.760 --> 27:19.440
I saw the flowers here
bloom quite beautifully,

27:20.960 --> 27:22.160
so I couldn't bear to pluck them.

27:23.090 --> 27:26.930
♪In the dream♪

27:29.460 --> 27:30.740
♪Singing my yearning♪

27:31.400 --> 27:33.880
I understand, Master.

27:36.040 --> 27:41.240
(Master, this time, it's truly goodbye.)

27:54.640 --> 27:55.880
Have you said farewell to Hanjiang?

28:04.600 --> 28:05.680
I've always wanted to know

28:06.600 --> 28:09.000
what exactly happened
on July 14th, three years ago.

28:12.000 --> 28:15.760
But I never expected it to be me.

28:20.280 --> 28:21.280
Do you regret seeing him?

28:24.280 --> 28:28.040
Perhaps. But I saw him one last time

28:30.640 --> 28:35.880
and let him personally adorn me
with this hibiscus.

28:39.920 --> 28:43.640
And Master ultimately granted my wish.

28:45.760 --> 28:47.640
Although Master was gentle as a person,

28:48.560 --> 28:51.880
he truly was more stringent than others
as a master.

28:55.560 --> 28:59.760
This time, I went to see him at the risk
of disturbing the stream of time.

29:00.840 --> 29:05.600
Under normal circumstances,
he might have expelled me.

29:08.000 --> 29:09.840
You are Xiu,
whom he has raised since childhood.

29:10.520 --> 29:11.540
How could he bear to do that?

29:15.840 --> 29:16.850
Let's go.

29:20.640 --> 29:24.360
(The departed have long been gone.
The living will harbor peace forever.)

29:32.520 --> 29:35.040
Miss Ming, how is Mr. Gu doing?

29:38.160 --> 29:40.400
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

29:42.880 --> 29:44.920
Being able to see the one cherished
in one's heart again

29:45.440 --> 29:46.600
is truly a fortunate thing.

30:17.960 --> 30:22.280
Qi, are you afraid that after we go in,

30:23.240 --> 30:24.640
we will no longer remember Bian Luohuan?

30:27.160 --> 30:28.680
Once we return to the future,

30:29.200 --> 30:31.040
the path of heaven
will erase everything about him.

30:32.640 --> 30:35.000
It will be as if he never existed.

30:37.720 --> 30:39.400
But can the trace of one's existence

30:42.320 --> 30:44.960
really be quietly erased completely?

30:49.040 --> 30:51.240
As long as his faith and mission
are in our hearts,

30:53.320 --> 30:54.520
even if we no longer remember him,

30:58.000 --> 30:59.000
he is still alive.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.460
I like you.

32:23.800 --> 32:24.850
I like you.

32:32.120 --> 32:34.920
(This voice seems familiar.)

32:36.200 --> 32:37.880
(Why can't I remember?)

32:59.880 --> 33:01.120
I like you.

33:29.880 --> 33:32.790
♪Looking back♪

33:33.910 --> 33:37.110
♪I try to bring back memories♪

33:38.000 --> 33:41.910
♪We're connected♪

33:41.910 --> 33:44.180
♪It's meant to be♪

33:45.780 --> 33:49.430
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

33:49.940 --> 33:53.750
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

33:53.750 --> 33:55.990
♪On a moonlight night♪

33:55.990 --> 33:57.970
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

33:57.970 --> 34:00.690
♪About you♪

34:00.690 --> 34:03.990
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

34:04.690 --> 34:08.080
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

34:08.630 --> 34:10.480
♪The past glided before my mind♪

34:10.480 --> 34:12.719
♪I smiled and cried♪

34:12.719 --> 34:17.980
♪For happiness♪

34:17.980 --> 34:21.880
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

34:21.880 --> 34:25.969
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

34:25.969 --> 34:27.920
♪In this tranquil world♪

34:27.920 --> 34:29.969
♪I've finally found you♪

34:29.969 --> 34:34.000
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

34:34.000 --> 34:37.750
♪I've been looking for you♪

34:37.750 --> 34:41.880
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

34:42.710 --> 34:44.150
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

34:44.150 --> 34:46.420
♪I engrave your name♪

34:46.420 --> 34:52.440
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

35:07.960 --> 35:10.960
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

35:11.930 --> 35:15.090
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

35:15.930 --> 35:19.860
♪Both of us get closer♪

35:19.860 --> 35:22.000
♪And watch the stars♪

35:23.770 --> 35:26.930
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

35:27.900 --> 35:31.060
♪Stories leave no trace behind♪

35:31.060 --> 35:33.810
♪On a moonlight night♪

35:33.810 --> 35:35.960
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

35:35.960 --> 35:38.610
♪About you♪

35:38.610 --> 35:42.200
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

35:42.740 --> 35:44.150
♪It's unforgettable♪

35:44.150 --> 35:46.100
♪It's all about you♪

35:46.710 --> 35:48.980
♪The past glided before my mind♪

35:48.980 --> 35:50.680
♪I smiled and cried♪

35:50.680 --> 35:55.760
♪For happiness♪

35:55.760 --> 35:59.700
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

35:59.700 --> 36:03.700
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

36:03.700 --> 36:05.940
♪In this tranquil world♪

36:05.940 --> 36:07.920
♪I've finally found you♪

36:07.920 --> 36:11.960
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

36:11.960 --> 36:15.890
♪I've been looking for you♪

36:15.890 --> 36:20.120
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

36:20.120 --> 36:22.130
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

36:22.130 --> 36:24.500
♪I engrave your name♪

36:24.500 --> 36:30.610
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪
